# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.

# Base URL of the API. Leave unset for local dev (Vite proxies /api to
# localhost:3001, see vite.config.ts) and for any setup where web+api share
# an origin (e.g. the API serving the built SPA). Set it only when web and
# api are deployed as separate Coolify apps on different origins.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.nsk.mpe-registry.com
